# File size (500 lines)

Law: new or edited `.rs` under `crates/`, `apps/`, and `xtask/` stay **under
500 physical lines**. The `cargo xtask size` lint (in `cargo test
--workspace`) enforces it; oversized legacy files ratchet via
`xtask/size-allowlist.toml`.

Before a change would exceed the cap, **split on a seam first** — one module,
one concern, named owner (Art. XII). Never grow an allowlisted file; shrink
the allowlist by splitting.

```text
// BAD — append 200 lines to board.rs
// GOOD — extract `board_paint_selection.rs`, re-export from `board`
```
